# 🇱🇰 TravelLK – AI Travel Planner for Sri Lanka

An AI-powered travel planning agent that creates personalized Sri Lanka itineraries based on your interests, budget, and trip duration. Built with Ollama (llama3.2), Streamlit, and SQLite.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🤖 **AI-powered planning** – Generates detailed day-by-day itineraries
- 🎯 **Personalized** – Based on your interests, budget & trip length
- 💬 **Follow-up chat** – Ask questions about your itinerary
- 🧠 **Memory** – Saves all past trips to SQLite
- 🗺️ **Popular destinations** – Covers all major Sri Lanka attractions
- 🌴 **Local tips** – Food, transport, hidden gems included

---

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```
travellk/
├── app.py        # Streamlit UI
├── agent.py      # AI planning agent (Ollama)
├── memory.py     # SQLite trip memory
└── README.md
```

---

## ⚙️ Setup

### 1. Install Ollama & pull model
```bash
ollama pull llama3.2
```

### 2. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install streamlit ollama
```

### 3. Run the app
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

---

## 🧠 How It Works

1. User selects trip duration, budget, and interests
2. AI agent (llama3.2) generates a full day-by-day itinerary
3. User can ask follow-up questions in the chat
4. Every trip is saved to SQLite memory for analytics

---

## 📦 Tech Stack

| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Streamlit | Web UI |
| Ollama (llama3.2) | Local LLM for planning |
| SQLite | Trip memory storage |

